  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "拜月老"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>阿&nbsp; &nbsp; 墨</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一擺一擺ê失敗，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">孽緣真是有夠害，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人財兩失真感慨，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">哪ē惹來桃花災？&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">姻緣kám是hiah奇怪，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">紅線雙頭怎安排，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">只有月老ē了解，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">beh緊beh慢在伊排。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若是有幸正緣來，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">結婚成家真福泰，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若無排--著哭悲哀，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">為啥我ē無人愛？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">朋友結婚笑hai-hai，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐月紅包了錢財，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">iáu-koh閒kah掠蠓刣，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">孤單老人可憐代。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám是生kah tsiah-nī bái，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">sì-kè相親lóng失敗，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">敗市痛苦啥人知，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tang時有thang運氣改？&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">透早起床畫目眉，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">妝kah suí-suí tuì tsia來，&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">sio-e-sio-kheh tsiah入內，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">廟公熱心好紹介。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">糖仔紅棗規桌排，&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">緣粉鉛錢上應該，&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">胭脂水粉mā tio̍h-ài，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">滿滿供品tsiânn phong-phài。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">謝神賀禮桌頂排，&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看著禮餅kat紅綵，&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">何時到我有好代？&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">善男信女誠心拜。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">三枝清香訴心懷，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">香煙傳達神明知，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">賜我一个好翁婿，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">hōo伊一个suí太太。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">為求紅線無凊彩，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">求伊應pue ài三擺，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">ǹg望緣份斟酌派，</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">良人何時tsiah ē來？</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrKEdZpbU0nXARc46V4D9CQBfe81bG6XaN0_5SfOm41kw3aKDDVR9g6dDhKYasBhrXy7Ky5oUjC3rkPmuCT29OFUT_NEaOQJOVIiXAdWfspB6M6gw5oI5UouzKH8gS9HQk1vtCoEfhvTIBGlkIAU2i_BgYxhcQwpYsienoHpe4Cp4MTpjIzLX0ec7W8RQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1361%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrKEdZpbU0nXARc46V4D9CQBfe81bG6XaN0_5SfOm41kw3aKDDVR9g6dDhKYasBhrXy7Ky5oUjC3rkPmuCT29OFUT_NEaOQJOVIiXAdWfspB6M6gw5oI5UouzKH8gS9HQk1vtCoEfhvTIBGlkIAU2i_BgYxhcQwpYsienoHpe4Cp4MTpjIzLX0ec7W8RQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1361%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjmyg95Q8rees1pS_t5fKNXMWSPVD8tVmCg8KWY5iGmZdI8iOY0hWRcv8h3UO